"use": "ファッションビル (a station-front fashion building, PARCO / マルイ class): 30 x 24 m, five storeys of 4.5 m, enterable (_Shop) -- F1 cosmetics and goods with two register counters, F2-F3 fashion (clothes rails), F4 electronics, F5 the restaurant floor; an escalator atrium (an up and a down escalator, walkable), a bank of two lifts, four corner stairs (二方向避難, one to the roof), men's / women's / accessible WCs each floor; three entrances. probe_xz is the atrium floor. kits/interiors/FashionBuilding.blend (the artist's; a PLACEHOLDER shell and fit-out, ARTIST_NOTES.md lists what to replace)",
"wall_top_m": 22.5
}

